      "writtenOn": "2024-03-25T06:58:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Instead of shelling out to cmd can we find the network_stack service binder and send the command ourselves? I think we can get the binder by calling NetworkStack.getService(). Then we can call shellCommand() on the resulting IBinder.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 70,
        "startChar": 17,
